    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Careful with two that trick you",
     "texto": [
      "**きれい** (pretty, clean) and **きらい** (disliked) end in い, but they are **-na** adjectives: you say **きれい な**, not «きれい へや».",
      "To ask what something is like: **どんな** + noun: **どんな まち です か** (what kind of town is it?)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
